			"Message": "chore(Land): Sync Land/Element submodules to latest revisions\n\nAdvance all Land/Element submodule references to their current HEADs to maintain build consistency across the editor architecture. This update includes Common, Echo, Maintain, Output, Rest, and SideCar.\n\nThis synchronization incorporates recent PascalCase refactoring, parameter extraction improvements, and build artifact updates generated in the submodules. Ensures the main Land repository aligns with the latest state of its constituent components.",
